# ============================================================
# .gitignore — ESP32 Truck Overtracking Warning System
# ============================================================

# ------------- OS / Editor -------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace

# ------------- Office temp files -------------
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pptx
~$*.doc
~$*.xls

# ------------- Build artifacts (Arduino) -------------
build/
*.bin
*.elf
*.map
*.hex
*.uf2

# Arduino IDE 2.x build output
.ArduinoIDE/build/
.cache/
*.tmp.*

# ------------- MATLAB -------------
*.asv
*.m~
*.mat
*.fig
*.slxc
slprj/

# ------------- Python (for OpenMV / data tools) -------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
.env

# ------------- Logs / data captures -------------
logs/
*.log
*.csv.bak
*.local.csv
data/raw/
*.bag

# ------------- MATLAB demo run outputs -------------
# Each run of run_phase1_demo creates a timestamped subfolder under Matlab/runs/.
# Keep README, ignore everything else (figures regenerate every run).
Matlab/runs/*
!Matlab/runs/README.md
!Matlab/runs/.gitkeep

# ------------- Large model files -------------
*.tflite.bak
*.h5
*.onnx
*.pth

# ------------- Node / Electron (PID scenario desktop wrapper) -------------
node_modules/
desktop-dist/
npm-debug.log*
package-lock.json

# ------------- IDE / Sandbox workspaces -------------
# trae IDE working directory: keeps a sandboxed copy of files + node_modules.
# Useful artifacts (HTML / m / .md) are mirrored to repo root, so trae/ itself
# should never be committed.
trae/

# 同一沙箱被改名后的目录（用户/Trae IDE 把 trae/ 改成 PID工况仿真导出器/）。
# 仍然是沙箱副本 + node_modules，不进仓库。
PID工况仿真导出器/

# Windows shortcuts: hardcoded absolute paths, never portable, must not be tracked.
*.lnk

# ------------- AI agent runtime state -------------
# Anthropic / superpowers session state directories (contain ephemeral logs)
.superpowers/
.claude/
.cursor/
